.TH DEMO\-TRACE\-INJECTOR 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
demo\-trace\-injector \- Publish synthetic eBPF trace events to the Wotan topics the dashboard ingests, for demos.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B demo\-trace\-injector
