.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH NOTES
Publishes as the unheaded\-cli identity; key from AUTH_KEY_FILE or /etc/unheaded/keys/unheaded\-cli.key.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
